      "text_preview": "-\nThis writ petition is filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of the India seeking the following reliefs:-\n\"to issue a writ, order or direction more particularly one in the nature of Writ of Mandamus declaring the notification No.318/"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4813768bc14e4465958de858d415ee72_4",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But today also there is no representation on behalf of the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cb469f3cf2fe4325b318c1813c90047d_6",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the above discussion, the legal position is abundantly clear that the COTPA, 2003 is a special Act specifically dealing with Tobacco and Tobacco products by including Pan Masala or any chewing material having Tobacco as one of it"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d93ab8f96ee64c45ae6071674ad1323e_7",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The FSSA, 2006 being a general Act, provides that it is an Act to consolidate the laws relating to food and to establish the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India for laying down science based standards for articles of food and to re"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6726f43a90634f629325ce71333747bc_8",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, the FSSA, 2006 deals with food as defined under Section 3(j) of the said Act, whereas Tobacco and Tobacco products are covered under the COPTA, 2003."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ac3409cf6e2c4972be57a5214ded3bb0_9",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Since Godawat Pan Masala Products I.P. Ltd. (supra) still holds the field, Pan Masala or Gutka containing Tobacco, cannot be considered to be \"food\"\nand the Commissioner of Food Safety, Andhra Pradesh is neither authorized nor has any juris"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "762087d0986a4b72a1e0dfa757e01ce3_10",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "35. Ex Consequenti, it is declared that the Commissioner of Food Safety, Andhra Pradesh is neither authorized nor having any jurisdiction to issue the impugned notification, prohibiting the manufacture, storage distribution, transportation "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7bf29926e37c47bd8c0f30982c2c2169_11",
